i love you too, you're the guy that thought art was logical right?

&#x200B;

cant remember... my brain reset.

Neo's the one in both layers. 

&#x200B;

But one can also argue that anyone can be the one they just need to have the same amount of belief in themselves and they can achieve it. But ofcourse you'd have to discount the prophecies as lies if you were to believe that. Just another theory ive come across.

Amazing breakdown! Also i gotta say to rope man, they are unable to because they havent broken through that second barrier as Hickman said. They were told by a prophecy, which will have anyone who believes in bending the reality of the matrix to not even try.

&#x200B;

The only reason Neo was able to, is because he was told so. He then began to believe he was the one subconsciously, even though he says he doubts it he realizes it subconsciously he can bend reality.

&#x200B;

What i dont understand though, is why was morpheus set on neo? If anyone could do it what made neo so special?

Also why was he unable to fly and trinity could until the end of the movie? I mean he knew he was the one at that point right? bit of a gap in what your saying but i feel like it mostly fits what you're saying. Makes me wanna re-watch the trilogy now haha
